        "description": "FSE Cleaning Services is a free theme suitable for cleaning companies specializing in carpet cleaning, deep cleaning, steam cleaning, rug cleaning, residential cleaning, commercial cleaning, move-out cleaning, property cleaning, sanitation services, maintenance services, maid service, janitorial service, housekeeper sites, eco cleaning, local cleaning businesses, office cleaning services, building maintenance, and car wash companies. Its sleek, professional design creates a spectacular online presence and can be adapted for related industries such as gardening, corporate services, construction, hotels, restaurants, flower shops, travel, education, medical, fitness, and wedding websites. The theme features a fully responsive layout for seamless viewing across all devices, SEO-friendly code for higher search engine rankings, and cross-browser support for uninterrupted performance. It includes pre-made sections and templates for services, testimonials, and contact pages, making website setup fast and easy. Translation-ready and kept up to date with the latest versions, it ensures accessibility for a global audience and full compatibility with updates. User-friendly for both beginners and professionals, the theme provides effortless installation and thorough documentation. For extended functionality, FSE Cleaning Services integrates seamlessly with the Contact Form 7 plugin for creating professional contact and inquiry forms, enhancing client interaction and lead generation. Demo Link: https://pattern.cretathemes.com/fse-cleaning-services/"
